	(text "10 kΩ pull-up (open-collector Hall outputs)\nRC filter 1 kΩ / 1 nF: τ = 1 µs, passes >100 kHz"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 238.76 246.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2aebdf7a-11e7-5f6d-92dc-2db09ff10b3e")
	)
	(text "• 20 kHz PWM (LEDC) on PWMA/PWMB. Duty-cycle cap = 6.0 V / VSYS (6 V motors; 71 % at 8.4 V).\n• STBY has an internal 200 kΩ pull-down: the motors stay in standby while the ESP32-S3 boots.\n• VM straight from VSYS (6.2–8.4 V; TB6612 rated 15 V abs., 13.5 V operating). 1.2 A avg / 3.2 A peak per channel.\n• VM decoupling: 100 µF electrolytic (its ESR damps) + 2×22 µF + 100 nF tight to VM1–VM3 (see SIM1).\n• Stall: firmware cuts the channel if PWM > 50 % and the encoder does not count for 300 ms."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24.13 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8e97d1bc-a359-59a3-b0ed-bf669d170fdb")
	)
